title: Have You Met Miss Jones
key: F
tempo: 132
style: jazz

// Thirty-two bars, AABA. The A sections are a chord a bar round F, with a
// diminished chord passing up to the two; the first A turns back to the top,
// the second goes to the four, the last comes home. The bridge moves by
// major thirds: B-flat, G-flat, D, G-flat, each reached by its own two-five,
// and a two-five home.
[A]
| Fmaj7 | F#dim7 | Gm7 | C7 |
| Am7   | Dm7    | Gm7 | C7 |

[A2]
| Fmaj7 | F#dim7 | Gm7 | C7 |
| Am7   | Dm7    | Cm7 | F7 |

[B]
| Bbmaj7 | Abm7 Db7 | Gbmaj7 | Em7 A7 |
| Dmaj7  | Abm7 Db7 | Gbmaj7 | Gm7 C7 |

[A3]
| Fmaj7  | F#dim7 | Gm7   | C7     |
| Am7 D7 | Gm7 C7 | Fmaj7 | Gm7 C7 |
